    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Suita lies as a northern suburb of Osaka, forming part of the larger Kyoto–Osaka–Kobe metropolitan area.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        13
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Suita"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The northern edge of Suita is marked by gently sloping Senri Hills, while the south is a flat plain fed by the Yodo River.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        15
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Suita"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Suita experiences a humid subtropical climate, with warm summers averaging 26.9 °C in August and cool winters around 3.6 °C in January.",
